        "original_id": "7d0db0f3-bb67-58a9-9d58-9b552f22dfce",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: G. V. Prakash Kumar, Ashrita Shetty, Vetrimaaran, Manimaran, Vinod, Prashant Narayanan\n- Films: Veyyil, Udhayam NH4, Naan Thaan Siva\n- Companies: S Pictures\n- Roles: lead role, antagonist, composer\n\nFacts:\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar's first film was S Pictures' Veyyil in 2006.\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar became popular in Tamil cinema by the early 2010s.\n- Vetrimaaran and Manimaran approached Ashrita Shetty to play the lead role in Udhayam NH4.\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar composed the soundtrack and background score for Udhayam NH4.\n- Naan Thaan Siva features newcomer Vinod and Ashrita Shetty in the leading roles.\n- Prashant Narayanan portrays the antagonist in Naan Thaan Siva.",
